transitively pulls in `spring-webmvc` and `spring-context`) should be sufficient. Explicitly declaring these individual components often signals either redundancy or a misconfiguration. 
If removing them breaks the build, then I know we have a deeper, more fundamental issue.

Considering the constraints – specifically, maintaining existing application behavior and avoiding major Spring Boot upgrades – this project's configuration is already in a precarious 
